The hero character has a guitar that is the primary weapon for attack. The sword of the character will glow in the presence of enemies with a little bit of particle effect. The glow on the sword will pulsate on the beat of the song playing in the background. Based on that the player will do the light attack. The heavy attack is a hold and release attack the more the player holds the higher the damage and the release should only be done on beat else the damage will be less powerful than the light attack. On attack on an enemy the damage is shown on screen and goes away. There are three basic enemies: The slugs, The drones and The sentries. The player's objective is to clear the platform and reach the boss and defeat him. Creation of this one entire level from scratch from start to end is the objective for the next one week for the team.

