Notes:
------

Rahul:	The enemies will have patrol mode, alerted mode and attack mode animations

Attack Logic: (player has to feel the punishment)

- Light attack cooldown time: a little more than half a beat (0.6 beat or higher)
- Heavy attack cooldown time: same cold down as light attack

- On-beat light attack: 3 dmg
- Off-beat light attack: 1 dmg
- On-beat heavy attack attack: 8 dmg 
- Off-beat heavy attack: 2 dmg

On-beat heavy highest
On-beat light higher
Off-beat heavy lower
Off-beat light lowest

Enemies HP:

Slugs: 7 HP

Drones: 6 HP

Sentries: 9 HP

Boss: 30 HP